            <ArticleTitle>Serum sickness-like reaction in children due to cefditoren.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>327-8</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1111/j.1525-1470.2011.01539.x</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>We describe the case of a 7-year-old boy with urticaria, fever, and arthritis that appeared 10 days after starting cefditoren therapy for acute tonsillopharyngitis, which was diagnosed as a serum sickness-like reaction due to this medication.</AbstractText>
